        "slc_2f5c00a116846600804e42793e7f61f9a74446d96b64920c2137204c5577e4e0"
      ],
      "text": "Pi ships without a built-in permission system for filesystem, process, network, or credential access; by default it runs with the permissions of the launching user and process."
    },
